@startuml Activity_Overall
title AI Recruitment System — Overall Activity Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #636B2F
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #3D4127

|Company Admin|
start
:Sign up & register company;
:Upload SECP / NTN document;
|System Admin|
:Review company documents;
if (Documents valid?) then (yes)
  :Approve company (email sent);
else (no)
  :Reject with reason (email sent);
  |Company Admin|
  :Correct details & resubmit;
  stop
endif
|Company Admin|
:Invite recruiter (tokenized email link);
|Recruiter|
:Accept invitation & set password;
:Create job (optionally AI-generated JD);
:Publish job;
fork
  |Applicant|
  :Sign up / log in;
  :Upload resume (PDF / DOCX);
  |System (AI)|
  :Extract text, parse skills,\neducation & experience;
  :Generate resume embedding;
  |Applicant|
  :View AI resume analysis (optional);
  :Browse jobs & apply;
fork again
  |Recruiter|
  :Bulk upload / stage external resumes;
end fork
|Recruiter|
:Enter preferences & formula weights;
|System (AI)|
:Embed JD & decompose preferences;
:Drop candidates matching negative keywords;
:Score = jd_w x cos(JD) + pref_w x cos(pref);
:LLM re-rank & generate insights;
:Save top-N as SHORTLISTED (files to R2);
|Recruiter|
:Review ranked candidates & insights;
if (Proceed with candidate?) then (yes)
  :Generate interview kit;
  :Send shortlist email / set INTERVIEW;
else (no)
  :Set status REJECTED;
endif
|Applicant|
:Track application status;
stop
@enduml
